 Question - "Given two strings s and t, return true if the two strings are anagrams of each other, otherwise return false.

Two strings are anagrams if they contain the same characters, with each character appearing the same number of times, regardless of order."

Link - https://neetcode.io/problems/is-anagram/question

Code - 

class Solution {
    public boolean isAnagram(String s, String t) {

        char[] c = s.toCharArray();
        char[] ch = t.toCharArray();
        Arrays.sort(c);
        Arrays.sort(ch);
        String newS = String.valueOf(c);
        String newT = String.valueOf(ch);
        if(newS.equals(newT))
         return true;
        else
         return false;        

    }
}

